ed ads?</h2></div> <p>Geometry Spot needs your OK to let our ad partners use your activity on other sites to pick your ads. It&#39;s not needed to use the site, saying no changes nothing, and you can change it anytime in Profile &gt; Privacy. <a href="/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a></p> <div class="gs-dialog__pair"> <button type="button" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary" id="gs-consent-yes">Yes</button> <button type="button" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary" id="gs-consent-no">No thanks</button> </div> </div> <div id="gs-consent-confirm" hidden> <h2>Confirm personalized ads?</h2> <p>You can turn them off anytime in Profile &gt; Privacy.</p> <div class="gs-dialog__pair"> <button type="button" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary" id="gs-consent-confirm-yes">Confirm</button> <button type="button" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary" id="gs-consent-confirm-no">Cancel</button> </div> </div> </dialog> <dialog class="gs-dialog gs-verify" id="gs-verify" aria-labelledby="gs-verify-title"> <div class="gs-dialog__top"><h2 id="gs-verify-title" tabindex="-1">Verify your email</h2><button type="button" class="gs-dialog__close" id="gs-verify-x" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1d2433" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"></path></svg></button></div> <p id="gs-verify-text"></p> <div class="gs-verify__stack"> <p class="gs-note" id="gs-verify-dev" hidden></p> <form id="gs-verify-form" class="gs-verify__row" novalidate> <input class="gs-verify__code" id="gs-verify-code" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="6" placeholder="000000" aria-label="6-digit code from your email"> <button type="submit" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary" id="gs-verify-submit">Verify</button> </form> <button type="button" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary" id="gs-verify-send" hidden>Email me a code</button> <div class="gs-verify__links"> <button type="button" class="gs-linkbtn" id="gs-verify-resend">Send a new code</button> <span class="gs-verify__sep" id="gs-verify-sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> <button type="button" class="gs-linkbtn" id="gs-verify-fix" aria-controls="gs-verify-fix-form" aria-expanded="false">Wrong email?</button> </div> <form id="gs-verify-fix-form" class="gs-verify__row" hidden novalidate> <input class="gs-verify__email" id="gs-verify-new-email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" aria-label="Your email"> <button type="submit" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary">Send code</button> </form> <p class="gs-alert" id="gs-verify-error" role="alert" hidden></p> <div id="gs-verify-pw-block" class="gs-verify__stack"> <div class="gs-verify__or">or</div> <button type="button" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary" id="gs-verify-pw-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="gs-verify-pw-form">Set a password</button> <form id="gs-verify-pw-form" class="gs-verify__stack" hidden novalidate> <div class="gs-grid2"> <label class="gs-field">Password<input id="gs-verify-pw" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" maxlength="72"></label> <label class="gs-field">Confirm<input id="gs-verify-pw2" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" maxlength="72"></label> </div> <button type="submit" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary">Save password</button> </form> </div> <p class="gs-note" id="gs-verify-pw-done" hidden>Password saved. You can log in with it or with an email code.</p> <button type="button" class="gs-btn gs-btn--plain gs-verify__later" id="gs-verify-later">I'll do it later</button> </div> </dialog> <dialog class="gs-dialog" id="gs-choice" aria-labelledby="gs-choice-title"> <h2 id="gs-choice-title" tabindex="-1" autofocus></h2> <p id="gs-choice-text"></p> <div class="gs-dialog__pair" id="gs-choice-pair"> <button type="button" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary" id="gs-choice-yes">Yes</button> <button type="button" class="gs-btn gs-btn--primary" id="gs-choice-no">No thanks</button> </div> </d